  "system": {
    "type": "standard",
    "description": "<p><em>A crushing mass of flesh and tentacles tears open reality, accompanied by a sudden increase in gravity.</em></p><h3>Manifest</h3><p>The Entity materializes as a separate, physical creature on the battlefield. The creature has the stats listed by your Entity. The following rules apply:</p><ul><li><p>While within Far range, you can command the creature with a Power Trait Roll (attack, interact with environment as per GM choice).</p></li><li><p>When the creature takes damage, you must mark your Hit Points depending on the severity of the damage. You can <strong>spend an Echo</strong> to reduce the severity by one threshold; there is no other way to reduce the damage taken. After they take damage, you can choose to dismiss them.</p></li><li><p>The creature has traits and features depending on its type. Evasion and Damage Thresholds scale according to the character’s tier: Tier 1 | 2 | 3 | 4.</p></li></ul><table><thead><tr><th>Tier</th><th>Evasion</th><th>Damage Thresholds</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Tier 1</td><td>8</td><td>9/18</td></tr><tr><td>Tier 2</td><td>9</td><td>15/30</td></tr><tr><td>Tier 3</td><td>10</td><td>20/40</td></tr><tr><td>Tier 4</td><td>11</td><td>25/52</td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>Crushing Gravity:</strong> Very Close | <strong>d10 + Power Trait</strong> kinetic damage using your Proficiency</p><h3>Vessel</h3><p>The Entity inhabits your character, merging directly with your physical body. You gain the benefits listed by your Entity.</p><p><em>Your throat splits into gills as you radiate suffocating, heavy pressure.</em></p><p>You don’t need to breathe and you can survive in the cold vacuum of space. In addition, make a <strong>Power Roll (12)</strong>. On a success, <strong>spend an Echo</strong> to force a target within Close range to make a Reaction Roll (11). On a failure, they must mark <strong>1d4</strong> Stress as they gasp for air in your crushing presence. On a success, they must mark a Stress.</p>",
